WEBVTT

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:40.830
Searching for the Darkstar
weapon, our party travels on.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:43.700
I knew finding it
wasn't going to be easy...

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.610
...but this is turning out
to be REALLY dangerous!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:50.610
On top of that, a revenge-
crazed Jillas showed up...

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:52.080
...and things got even worse!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:57.710
Gourry! What have you done?!
You let him get the Sword of Light!

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.920
A turn of events like this
is something my pride...

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:06.650
My pride! My pride!!!
MY PRI DE WON'T ALLOW!!!

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.600
I'll follow that little creep
down to hell if I have to!

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:22.710
I did it! I did it! I did it!
I got it!

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.150
STOP! STO-O-O-OP!!!

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:30.820
Darn it, by him... By HI M?!

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:33.290
HE stole the
Sword of Light from us?!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:34.720
Gourry, you I DIOT!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:35.990
MORON!

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:36.960
OCTOPUS!

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:37.990
SQUI D HEAD!

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.550
BAIT FOR BRAI NS!

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.360
You don't have to go that far,
you know...

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:45.200
Lina, this is no time to be upset!
We have to get him!

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:46.430
I know!

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:51.370
I got it! I got it!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.780
AGH!!! Again?!

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:04.720
Miss Lina, let's calm down a little!

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:12.920
This is the first time I've ever won!
The first time in my life!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.960
Boss... Lord Valgaav...

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.360
I was finally useful to them!

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.760
RAYWI NG!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:26.200
Dammit! We're still on holy ground
and our magic still won't work?!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.310
He's taken everything
into account, hasn't he?

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:33.950
Are we too late!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.590
Wait!

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:38.850
I knew it...

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.120
In that case... Gourry!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:44.990
I'm on it!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:52.530
COME BACK HERE!

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.000
TAKE THIS!

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.540
Torpedoes?!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.280
Why, that little!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.440
My sword!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.760
I'm going to take it back!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:24.060
Why, you!
This one's for Gourry!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.330
That was close...

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.570
What do you
think you're doing?!

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.580
What's wrong?

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.410
This situation we're in...

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.920
Going by past experience,
up ahead is going to be!

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.580
Oh, no way!
On top of everything else?

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:54.130
AGH!!! A WATERFALL!!!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:59.160
- Same old pattern!
- Same old cheap joke.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:28.860
Guess I lost them.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.470
HOLD IT!!!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.570
Those guys are stubborn!
But I won't let them have this!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.580
I'll be sure to
lose them in here!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:55.690
Lighting!

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.450
All right!
My powers are back!

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:05.070
Okay... I'm sure he
ran into here, but...

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.500
It'll be a pain and a half finding
that slippery little guy in here.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.510
Even so, we have to do it.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:12.870
Hey, you guys!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.210
We'll settle this right here!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.160
It's not over yet!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.730
Why are you picking on ME?!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.760
And now you die!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.170
Uh-oh, she's losing it!

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:18.970
Filia! Stop it! Stop it!
Stop! Stop! STOP!!!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.530
Cut it out!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.700
What was I just doing?

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.310
Now look!

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:31.750
OH, NO! The little
creep slipped away!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.740
My Sword of Light... Oh...

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.720
My Sword of Light...
My Sword of Light...

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:39.820
Oh... My ancestors
will never forgive me...

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.020
By that little creep...
That little creep...

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.760
That little creep...
That little creep...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.700
My sword... My sword...

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:51.170
Please, snap out of it!

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.900
Miss Lina! Miss Lina!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.130
This is no time to be
in a state of shock!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.680
My sword... My sword...

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:15.450
Hey!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.290
Hey... Hey...

00:09:17.390 --> 00:09:20.660
Hey... Hey... Hey...

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:25.700
HEY!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.100
I think I found
where he ran to.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.530
You what?!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.420
Where the heck?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.010
What is all this?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.410
It doesn't seem that old...

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.990
I can feel a strong energy
flowing from the pillar of light.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:22.360
I see...
Then this must be...

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:26.760
Valgaav's main base, apparently.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.990
Xellos!

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:30.700
Where have you been until now?!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.000
Oh, dear!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:36.010
I had some tedious work to do
and couldn't get away from it.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.940
For heaven's sake! You appear
when we don't want you...

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.000
...and vanish
when you can be useful!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.110
Someone who prays to
the Fire Dragon King...

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.950
...shouldn't depend on a
Monster like me, should they?

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.640
Who said we depend on you?!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:48.450
In any case...

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:52.560
If this is their main base,
we'd better hurry.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:55.750
You're right.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.900
Lord Valgaav!

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:50.140
Gravos...
They got Boss Gravos!

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:52.450
I'll get revenge on them!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:58.110
I'll get my revenge!

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:07.090
Just you wait...
I'll end everything here.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.460
I'll end EVERYTHI NG.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:27.270
<i>Lord Valgaav... I'm going to
repay you for helping me that time!</i>

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:32.080
Darn it...
Lots of ways in, aren't there?

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.590
- Zel and Amelia, take the left.
- Right!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.110
If you find anything,
signal us at once!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:37.950
Right!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.620
Filia and Xellos,
take the right!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:40.990
You can't be...

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.250
Get going!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.120
R- Right!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:43.990
Let's be off.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.630
Gourry, you and me...

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.970
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.470
Get it together, you idiot!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:04.140
The path splits again.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.280
Which way shall we go?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:14.690
Um, do all priestesses in this world
make predictions with that method?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.560
Just shut up!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:26.870
Um, perhaps you
should knock it over.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.980
The prophecy has been made!
The Sword of Light is that way!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.040
No kidding?

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:41.780
Anyway, it's that way!
Come along, now!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:43.080
R- Right!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:47.890
So, I lied.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.920
I lied, too.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.600
A marker spell. I see...

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:02.570
This way, if we should get lost,
we'll be all right.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.040
Let's hurry!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.550
Gourry, look!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.950
Look! Look! Look!
Look! Look! Look! Look!

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.720
What have I been doing?!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.990
For crying out... Let's go!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:27.090
<i>Lord Valgaav! I...</i>

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.930
I'm totally lost!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.990
Where am I?!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.460
Damu Bras!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.610
This is where we were before.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.170
Which means...

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.270
Yeah...

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:46.640
We are completely lost!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.250
Apparently.

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:49.550
What'll we do?

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:53.420
If Filia was here,
we could have some tea.

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:54.790
Want some tea?

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.350
Not a bad idea.

00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.620
You won't get away!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.530
RAFAHS SEED!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:15.780
Our chase ends here.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.580
Don't assume you've won!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:22.420
The Red Fox tribe
never forget a grudge!

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:25.080
I'll never give up!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.940
<i>What is this place?</i>

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.290
Whoa! Lina!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.450
Gourry!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.200
Is... Isn't this?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.140
Almayce, from the Overworld.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.630
Is he dead?

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:18.070
Dunno. Doesn't look like it.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.910
Now what?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:24.640
Leave him alone. We have to get
the Sword of Light back fast!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:36.190
Gorun Nova has been stolen?

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.700
If it falls into
Valgaav's hands...

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:43.860
...he will summon
Darkstar to this place.

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:47.830
What are you saying?
That's what YOU were gonna do!

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.230
No...

00:18:53.350 --> 00:19:01.150
We... Summoning Darkstar here
is not our ultimate objective.

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:04.680
What do you mean?

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:08.760
What will you do after
you summon Darkstar?

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.930
Our ultimate objective...

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:16.360
...is to destroy Darkstar!

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:18.800
To what?!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.570
Xellos...

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:09.450
It would seem that your dragon
power is still causing you pain.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:17.490
Oh, my.
I didn't come to fight you.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.960
Why should I have to stay
with some filthy Monster?!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.210
Xellos? And Valgaav?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.670
I came here for a
different reason this time.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.480
What do you mean?

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:44.680
Let's get to the point.
The reason I've come before you...

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:49.880
...is because I've been ordered to
bring you to the Monster race's side.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:59.300
<i>What was that?!
What is he up to?!</i>

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:25.480
Xellos, just what
are you planning?!

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:28.320
You wouldn't be trying to
double-cross us, would you?!

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:31.750
Next time, " An Explosive Situation!
The One Who Holds the Key!"

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.130
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
